// Ch13 B01 "The still city" (C, 1.5 min) and B02 "The High Warden's house" (C, 2 min). act2_ch13.md §2.
// RULE 4: nothing on the water moves; every barge is poled with no wake. A01: gold bowl-domes doubled in a
// mirror lagoon (cold gold: wealth, not warmth). A02: the outer moorings; polers leave no wake. A03: KERRID
// steps off at the outer moorings and stays there STANDING among the polers (he never sits until Ch15); the
// party goes in without him (rule 3). B02: Sefir at his door: unnaturally still, no breathing idle, warm and
// delighted (rule 6: no sneering villain). A05: half a beat's glance toward the outer moorings (ADR 0022 (c):
// he knows what Kerrid is and lets him be). A06: Toma's bow; his "And still" still answers (Ch14 is the first
// time it doesn't).
title: ch13_still_city
location: ch13/ansedra
---
@letterbox on
@camera A01
@music ansedra fade=2.0
@wait 5.0
@camera A02
@sfx pole_no_wake
@wait 2.0
Rhen [worried]: They're not making ripples. How are they not making ripples? #line:ch13_city_001
@wait 1.5
@camera A03
@mark kerrid kerrid_moorings walk
@anim asha look_at kerrid
@anim kerrid raise_hand
@wait 3.0
<<jump ch13_sefirs_house>>
===
title: ch13_sefirs_house
---
@camera A04
@music ansedra fade=1.0
@mark sefir sefir_door walk
@wait 1.5
Sefir [smile]: Lady Cantor. You have come further than most, and faster. Ansedra is yours. Rest here. Nothing in this city will hurry you. #line:ch13_house_001 #long
Sefir [soft_smile]: And you have come at a good time. In four days a Saltwright will marry a Warden's daughter, in the Lacquer Court, and I will say the words. #line:ch13_house_002 #long
Sefir [smile]: Mistress Varrow's brother. I believe she had something to do with it. #line:ch13_house_003
<<set $ch13_wedding_announced = true>>
@anim liss look_away
@wait 1.0
Sefir [tender]: The Sanctum is open to you tomorrow. #line:ch13_house_004
@anim sefir hold_out_key liss
Sefir [soft_smile]: And to you, Mistress Varrow, the Lamp Archive, for as long as you are our guest. #line:ch13_house_005
Sefir [soft_smile]: You were told for years the Order hides the Lit Age from your people. Read whatever you like. We have nothing to hide from a wright. #line:ch13_house_006 #long
@anim liss take_key
@wait 1.5
@camera A05
@anim sefir look_at outer_moorings
@wait 0.6
@anim sefir look_at asha
@camera A06
@anim toma bow sefir
Sefir [smile]: Be level, Okeru. #line:ch13_house_007 #tn:"The Order's greeting; the reply is 'And still'."
Toma [neutral]: And still, High Warden. #line:ch13_house_008
@wait 1.5
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
